# Raw source assets (photos, screenshots, logos) — not tracked.
# The website (index.html) embeds its images inline as base64, so these
# originals are kept only in OneDrive, not in git.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf

# ...except files this project actually needs tracked go here explicitly:
!.gitignore
!output/*.png
!output/*.jpg
!output/*.jpeg
# 치과지식 페이지(knowledge.html)가 서빙하는 캐러셀 이미지 — knowledge/build.py가 생성
!knowledge/img/**/*.jpg
# ...but not ad/campaign previews (Pages would serve them publicly)
output/엘리베이터광고_*

# Video/audio deliverables and generation sources — also OneDrive-only.
# This repo is published as-is by GitHub Pages, so anything committed here is publicly
# downloadable from the homepage domain, and 10–30MB clips would bloat every clone.
# (Two early mp4s in output/ were committed before this rule and stay tracked.)
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.m4a

# Google OAuth client secret downloads — never commit these.
client_secret_*.json
